<title>NETHERLANDS: Hunter Douglas proposes share split.</title>
<headline>Hunter Douglas proposes share split.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Window blinds maker Hunter Douglas said on Tuesday it proposed to split its common and preferred shares on a two to one basis.</p>
<p>The firm said it had taken the decision to facilitate trading in shares.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
